WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
BUILD 008. A WALL OF CHARTS.. More information is visible. The decision is still missing.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
START HERE. NAME THE DECISION.. Every retained metric must explain how it can change that decision.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
MAKE EVIDENCE LEGIBLE. SOURCE · FRESHNESS · COMPARISON · UNCERTAINTY. A highlighted number without context is not yet decision-ready.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
MAKE ACTION ACCOUNTABLE. DECISION → OWNER → ACTION → NEXT STATE. Add trigger, deadline, authority and escalation.

5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
HUMAN CONTROL. CONFLICTS NEED A PERSON.. The dashboard can expose a conflict. An accountable human must resolve it.

6
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
SAVE THIS. DATA IS NOT A DECISION.. Build the accountable path from evidence to action and observable change.

